{"seq":1,"slug":"package-design","title":"包设计原则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/shared-packages/package-design","wordCount":1022,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"包设计原则\">包设计原则</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>共享包设计的核心是控制&quot;对外承诺&quot;与&quot;内部实现&quot;的边界，由三个概念支撑：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>设计原则</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单一职责</td>\n<td>一个包因同一个原因而变化</td>\n<td>既不过粗也不过细，找内聚度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>API 表面积</td>\n<td>包对外暴露的公开接口数量</td>\n<td>每个公开 API 都是一份承诺</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Barrel export</td>\n<td>用 <code>index.ts</code> 统一管理公开接口</td>\n<td>控制表面积的主要手段</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键权衡在于<strong>粒度</strong>：包拆得太粗会退化成&quot;杂货铺&quot;，拆得太细则增加维护与发布负担，合理的做法是按&quot;共同变化原因&quot;聚合成包。而每一个公开 API 都意味着长期的维护承诺——判断是否暴露的标准是&quot;将来修改它的实现是否会破坏消费方&quot;。依赖设计遵循同一逻辑：能自行实现则零依赖，框架类依赖交给 peerDependencies。</p>\n<h2 id=\"单一职责原则\">单一职责原则</h2><p><strong>单一职责原则</strong>（Single Responsibility Principle）在包设计中的含义是：每个包应该只做一件事，并且做好这件事。一个名为 <code>@myorg/utils</code> 的包如果同时包含日期处理、HTTP 请求、字符串操作和文件系统工具，那它实际上是一个&quot;杂货铺&quot;而非一个有明确职责的包。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph &quot;❌ 违反单一职责&quot;&#10;        UTILS_BAD[&quot;@myorg/utils&lt;br/&gt;日期 + HTTP + 字符串 + 文件系统&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;✅ 遵循单一职责&quot;&#10;        DATE[&quot;@myorg/date-utils&quot;]&#10;        HTTP[&quot;@myorg/http-client&quot;]&#10;        STRING[&quot;@myorg/string-utils&quot;]&#10;        FS[&quot;@myorg/fs-utils&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph \"❌ 违反单一职责\"\n        UTILS_BAD[\"@myorg/utils&lt;br/&gt;日期 + HTTP + 字符串 + 文件系统\"]\n    end\n    subgraph \"✅ 遵循单一职责\"\n        DATE[\"@myorg/date-utils\"]\n        HTTP[\"@myorg/http-client\"]\n        STRING[\"@myorg/string-utils\"]\n        FS[\"@myorg/fs-utils\"]\n    end</pre><p>但&quot;单一职责&quot;不意味着把每个函数都拆成一个包。关键是找到合理的<strong>内聚度</strong>——包内的代码应该因为同一个原因而变化。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>拆分粒度</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>过粗</td>\n<td><code>@myorg/utils</code>（万能包）</td>\n<td>❌ 不推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适中</td>\n<td><code>@myorg/date-utils</code></td>\n<td>✅ 大多数场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过细</td>\n<td><code>@myorg/format-date</code></td>\n<td>❌ 通常不必要</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"api-surface-控制\">API Surface 控制</h2><p><strong>API 表面积</strong>（API Surface）是指包对外暴露的公开接口数量。表面积越大，包的维护负担越重——每一个公开 API 都是一个承诺，修改它可能影响所有消费方。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// packages/ui/src/button.ts&#10;interface ButtonProps {&#10;  variant: &#39;primary&#39; | &#39;secondary&#39; | &#39;ghost&#39;;&#10;  size: &#39;sm&#39; | &#39;md&#39; | &#39;lg&#39;;&#10;  children: React.ReactNode;&#10;  onClick?: () =&gt; void;&#10;  disabled?: boolean;&#10;}&#10;&#10;export function Button({ variant, size, children, onClick, disabled }: ButtonProps) {&#10;  const className = getButtonClassName(variant, size, disabled);&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;button className={className} onClick={onClick} disabled={disabled}&gt;&#10;      {children}&#10;    &lt;/button&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}&#10;&#10;function getButtonClassName(&#10;  variant: ButtonProps[&#39;variant&#39;],&#10;  size: ButtonProps[&#39;size&#39;],&#10;  disabled?: boolean,&#10;): string {&#10;  return [&#10;    &#39;btn&#39;,&#10;    `btn-${variant}`,&#10;    `btn-${size}`,&#10;    disabled &amp;&amp; &#39;btn-disabled&#39;,&#10;  ].filter(Boolean).join(&#39; &#39;);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// packages/ui/src/button.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ButtonProps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  variant</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'primary'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'secondary'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ghost'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'sm'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'md'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'lg'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  children</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> React</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ReactNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  onClick</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  disabled</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Button</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">variant</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">size</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">children</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">onClick</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">disabled</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ButtonProps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> className</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getButtonClassName</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(variant, size, disabled);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">button className</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{className} onClick</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{onClick} disabled</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{disabled}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">children</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">button</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getButtonClassName</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  variant</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ButtonProps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'variant'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ButtonProps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'size'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  disabled</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'btn'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    `btn-${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">variant</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    `btn-${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">size</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    disabled </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'btn-disabled'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ].</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Boolean).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">join</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">' '</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>上面的例子中，<code>Button</code> 组件和 <code>ButtonProps</code> 类型是公开 API，而 <code>getButtonClassName</code> 是内部实现。消费方无需知道样式类名如何生成。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 评估是否应该公开一个 API 的标准：如果将来需要修改它的实现，是否会破坏消费方的代码？如果会，就要三思是否真的需要暴露。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"barrel-exports\">Barrel Exports</h2><p><strong>Barrel export</strong> 是使用 <code>index.ts</code> 文件统一管理包的公开接口的模式。它是控制 API 表面积的主要手段：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// packages/ui/src/index.ts&#10;export { Button } from &#39;./button&#39;;&#10;export type { ButtonProps } from &#39;./button&#39;;&#10;export { Input } from &#39;./input&#39;;&#10;export type { InputProps } from &#39;./input&#39;;&#10;export { Modal } from &#39;./modal&#39;;&#10;export type { ModalProps } from &#39;./modal&#39;;&#10;export { Toast, useToast } from &#39;./toast&#39;;&#10;export type { ToastProps } from &#39;./toast&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// packages/ui/src/index.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Button } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './button'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ButtonProps } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './button'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Input } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './input'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { InputProps } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './input'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Modal } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './modal'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ModalProps } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './modal'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Toast, useToast } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './toast'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ToastProps } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './toast'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;@myorg/ui&quot;,&#10;  &quot;exports&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;.&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;types&quot;: &quot;./src/index.ts&quot;,&#10;      &quot;default&quot;: &quot;./src/index.ts&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@myorg/ui\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"exports\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \".\"</span><span style=\"