#9ECBFF\"> '@myorg/ui/button'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"包的内部结构\">包的内部结构</h2><p>一个设计良好的共享包应该有清晰的内部结构：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"packages/ui/&#10;├── src/&#10;│   ├── button.ts&#10;│   ├── button.test.ts&#10;│   ├── input.ts&#10;│   ├── input.test.ts&#10;│   ├── modal.ts&#10;│   ├── modal.test.ts&#10;│   ├── toast.ts&#10;│   ├── toast.test.ts&#10;│   ├── internal/&#10;│   │   ├── use-focus-trap.ts&#10;│   │   └── classname-utils.ts&#10;│   └── index.ts&#10;├── package.json&#10;├── tsconfig.json&#10;└── vitest.config.ts\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>packages/ui/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── button.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── button.test.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── input.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── input.test.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── modal.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── modal.test.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── toast.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── toast.test.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── internal/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── use-focus-trap.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── classname-utils.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── index.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── package.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── tsconfig.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── vitest.config.ts</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>目录/文件</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>src/index.ts</code></td>\n<td>Barrel export，定义公开 API</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>src/*.ts</code></td>\n<td>各组件/函数的实现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>src/*.test.ts</code></td>\n<td>对应的测试文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>src/internal/</code></td>\n<td>内部工具，不通过 index.ts 导出</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>internal/</code> 目录的约定明确告诉开发者：这些代码是内部实现，不应被外部包直接引用。配合 <code>exports</code> 字段的限制，可以在运行时也阻止外部访问。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"包的依赖设计\">包的依赖设计</h2><p>共享包应该尽量减少外部依赖，降低消费方的安装成本和潜在的版本冲突：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph 依赖决策树&#10;        Q1{功能是否可以&lt;br/&gt;纯手写实现？}&#10;        Q1 --&gt;|是| SELF[自行实现&lt;br/&gt;零依赖]&#10;        Q1 --&gt;|否| Q2{依赖是否足够小&lt;br/&gt;且稳定？}&#10;        Q2 --&gt;|是| DEP[添加为 dependency]&#10;        Q2 --&gt;|否| Q3{消费方也需要&lt;br/&gt;使用该依赖？}&#10;        Q3 --&gt;|是| PEER[添加为 peerDependency]&#10;        Q3 --&gt;|否| BUNDLE[打包进产物]&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph 依赖决策树\n        Q1{功能是否可以&lt;br/&gt;纯手写实现？}\n        Q1 --&gt;|是| SELF[自行实现&lt;br/&gt;零依赖]\n        Q1 --&gt;|否| Q2{依赖是否足够小&lt;br/&gt;且稳定？}\n        Q2 --&gt;|是| DEP[添加为 dependency]\n        Q2 --&gt;|否| Q3{消费方也需要&lt;br/&gt;使用该依赖？}\n        Q3 --&gt;|是| PEER[添加为 peerDependency]\n        Q3 --&gt;|否| BUNDLE[打包进产物]\n    end</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;@myorg/http-client&quot;,&#10;  &quot;dependencies&quot;: {},&#10;  &quot;peerDependencies&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;zod&quot;: &quot;^3.0.0&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;devDependencies&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;zod&quot;: &quot;^3.24.0&quot;,&#10;    &quot;vitest&quot;: &quot;^3.0.0&quot;,&#10;    &quot;typescript&quot;: &quot;^5.7.0&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@myorg/http-client\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"dependencies\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"peerDependencies\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"zod\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^3.0.0\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"devDependencies\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"zod\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^3.24.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"vitest\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^3.0.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"typescript\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^5.7.0\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"向后兼容与-breaking-changes\">向后兼容与 Breaking Changes</h2><p>共享包的 API 变更会影响仓库中所有消费方。管理 breaking changes 的原则：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>变更类型</th>\n<th>是否 Breaking</th>\n<th>处理方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>新增函数/组件</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>直接添加，minor 版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新增可选参数</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>直接添加，minor 版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>修改函数签名</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>提供过渡期，major 版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>删除公开 API</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>先标记 deprecated，再删除</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>修改返回类型</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>major 版本</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 渐进式 API 迁移&#10;/** @deprecated Use formatCurrency instead */&#10;export function formatMoney(amount: number): string {&#10;  return formatCurrency(amount, &#39;CNY&#39;);&#10;}&#10;&#10;export function formatCurrency(amount: number, currency: string): string {&#10;  return new Intl.NumberFormat(&#39;zh-CN&#39;, {&#10;    style: &#39;currency&#39;,&#10;    currency,&#10;  }).format(amount);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 渐进式 API 迁移</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/** </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@deprecated</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> Use formatCurrency instead */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> formatMoney</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> formatCurrency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CNY'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> formatCurrency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">currency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Intl.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">NumberFormat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'zh-CN'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    style: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'currency'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    currency,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">format</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((包设计原则))&#10;    单一职责&#10;      一个包做一件事&#10;      合理内聚度&#10;      避免万能包&#10;    API Surface&#10;      最小化公开接口&#10;      每个 API 是承诺&#10;      内部实现隐藏&#10;    Barrel Exports&#10;      index.ts 统一管理&#10;      子路径导出&#10;      exports 字段&#10;    依赖设计&#10;      最小化外部依赖&#10;      peer vs dependency&#10;      依赖决策树\">mindmap\n  root((包设计原则))\n    单一职责\n      一个包做一件事\n      合理内聚度\n      避免万能包\n    API Surface\n      最小化公开接口\n      每个 API 是承诺\n      内部实现隐藏\n    Barrel Exports\n      index.ts 统一管理\n      子路径导出\n      exports 字段\n    依赖设计\n      最小化外部依赖\n      peer vs dependency\n      依赖决策树</pre><ul>\n<li>单一职责原则要求每个包有明确的功能边界，既不过粗也不过细</li>\n<li>API 表面积应尽量小，每个公开接口都是一个需要长期维护的承诺</li>\n<li>Barrel exports 通过 <code>index.ts</code> 统一管理包的公开接口，配合 <code>exports</code> 字段限制访问</li>\n<li>共享包应最小化外部依赖，框架类依赖使用 peerDependencies</li>\n<li>Breaking changes 应提供过渡期，使用 <code>@deprecated</code> 标记引导消费方迁移</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"包设计原则","id":"包设计原则"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"单一职责原则","id":"单一职责原则"},{"level":2,"text":"API Surface 控制","id":"api-surface-控制"},{"level":2,"text":"Barrel Exports","id":"barrel-exports"},{"level":3,"text":"子路径导出","id":"子路径导出"},{"level":2,"text":"包的内部结构","id":"包的内部结构"},{"level":2,"text":"包的依赖设计","id":"包的依赖设计"},{"level":2,"text":"向后兼容与 Breaking Changes","id":"向后兼容与-breaking-changes"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"并行执行","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/build-and-task/parallel-execution"},"next":{"title":"版本策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/shared-packages/versioning-strategy"}}